# D-35 numeric suite: a hot arithmetic loop whose only semantic content is
# `number` math — the op mix exercises the checked-path cost the D-35 datum
# measures (trap-vs-wrap, 11 §R-17: threshold 2% on the numeric suite).

make changing total equal to 0
make changing acc equal to 1
repeat 3000000 times using i
    make changing x equal to remainder of i and 1000
    make changing y equal to x plus 7
    make changing z equal to y times 3
    make changing w equal to z divided evenly by 5
    make changing q equal to remainder of w and 97
    make changing s equal to x plus q
    increase total by s
    make changing a2 equal to acc times 3
    make changing a3 equal to a2 divided evenly by 7
    make changing a4 equal to a3 plus 1
    make changing a5 equal to remainder of a4 and 1000000007
    make acc equal to a5
say total
say acc
